---
<section id="skills" class="py-16 z-10 bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-black)_50%,transparent)] backdrop-blur-sm">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12">
      <span class="relative inline-block">
        Habilidades
      </span>
    </h2>

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <p class="text-lg text-text-muted max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      He desarrollado habilidades en diversas tecnologías a lo largo de mi carrera. Aquí hay un resumen de mis habilidades técnicas y nivel de competencia en cada área.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    {skillCategories.map(category => (
      <div class="bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border/20 p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mr-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d={category.icon} />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text">{category.name}</h3>
        </div>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 mt-4">
          {category.skills.map(skill => (
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-muted">{skill.name}</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-text-muted/70">{skill.level}%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full bg-[var(--color-gray-200)] rounded-full h-2">
                <div 
                  class="bg-primary h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-1000 ease-out"
                  style={`width: ${skill.level}%`}
                ></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <!-- Additional Skills -->
  <div class="mt-12 bg-bg-secondary rounded-xl border border-border/20 p-8">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">Otras Habilidades y Competencias</h3>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4">
      {[
        'Git', 'Linux', 'Bash', 'VSCode', 'Figma', 'Adobe XD',
        'Scrum', 'Agile', 'Jira', 'Trello', 'Notion', 'Slack',
        'Diseño Responsivo', 'SEO Básico', 'Accesibilidad Web',
        'Arquitectura Limpia', 'Patrones de Diseño', 'TDD'
      ].map(skill => (
        <div class="bg-bg/50 hover:bg-primary/5 border border-border/20 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center transition-colors">
          <span class="text-sm text-text-muted">{skill}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-border/10">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-4">
          Siempre estoy aprendiendo nuevas tecnologías y mejorando mis habilidades.
        </p>
        <button 
          class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors"
          onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' })"
        >
          ¿Necesitas algo específico? Contáctame
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</section>